------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Material derived from VERINA
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains material derived from VERINA
(https://github.com/sunblaze-ucb/verina), which is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0.

The benchmark variants under artifacts/variants/ and the equivalence
certificates under artifacts/certificates/ are mechanical rewrites of VERINA
task files at the commit pinned in configs/project.yaml.  In every variant the
specification block and the proof block of the upstream task are reproduced
byte-for-byte; only the implementation block is rewritten, and each rewrite is
accompanied by a Lean proof that the rewritten implementation equals the
original one.

VERINA itself is not redistributed here.  scripts/setup_verina.sh clones it at
the pinned commit.

